WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.866
Hi, and welcome to Ainable Setter. Over the next few minutes, I'll walk you through exactly how it works, from the very first message a lead sends you, all the way to a call on your calendar.

00:00:13.016 --> 00:00:31.087
So, here's the big picture. A lead messages you on Instagram. The AI replies in your voice, asks the right questions, and works out whether they're a good fit. When they are, it offers them real times from your calendar. They book, and all you have to do is show up for the call.

00:00:31.237 --> 00:00:42.738
Everything starts on the Get connected screen. You add a small helper to Chrome, sign in to Instagram, and send yourself a test message. Each step ticks itself off once it's done.

00:00:42.888 --> 00:00:55.157
Next up is your business brief. This is where you tell the AI what you sell, who it's for, and how you like to write. It only ever says what you've told it here, so it's worth ten minutes to get it right.

00:00:55.307 --> 00:01:04.695
Day to day, you'll spend most of your time in the inbox. Every conversation is right here, newest first, and a little dot means it hasn't been read yet.

00:01:04.845 --> 00:01:18.415
For each lead, you decide how much the AI does. Off means you write every reply yourself. Suggest means it drafts the reply, and you approve it. And Autopilot means it replies all on its own.

00:01:18.565 --> 00:01:30.237
Here's a draft it just wrote. You can send it as it is, change a few words, or ask for another version. Most people start on Suggest, and switch to Autopilot once they trust it.

00:01:30.387 --> 00:01:39.498
Over on the right, it keeps notes on every lead as the conversation goes. Their situation, what they want, and where they are in your pipeline.

00:01:39.648 --> 00:01:52.919
And when a lead is ready for a call, it doesn't just drop a booking link and hope. It checks your Calendly, offers two or three times that are actually free, and when they pick one, it sends them the link for that exact time.

00:01:53.069 --> 00:02:02.501
You connect your Calendly once, in Settings. Pick the meeting type and how many times to offer, and you can see exactly what it would offer a lead right now.

00:02:02.651 --> 00:02:13.362
If a lead asks something the AI hasn't been told, it won't make something up. It asks you instead. You answer once, and it remembers that answer for every lead after.

00:02:13.512 --> 00:02:21.578
The leads board shows where everyone stands, with one column for each stage, from the first message all the way to a won deal.

00:02:21.728 --> 00:02:31.522
If you'd like to start conversations yourself, Outreach sends a handful of first messages each day, from your own browser, at a pace that keeps your account safe.

00:02:31.672 --> 00:02:38.842
And Insights reads your numbers, and tells you in plain words the one change that would book you the most extra calls.

00:02:38.992 --> 00:02:45.607
Whenever you need a refresher, every part of the tool has its own short video, right here in Video guides.

00:02:45.757 --> 00:02:57.279
And that's really all there is to it. Get connected, fill in your brief, and let the AI start working your inbox. Head over to Get connected now. It only takes about ten minutes.
